# Agent Conduct — Spinecard mirror

The conduct of `private/.agent` applies here whole. In particular: `plans/`, `kickoffs/`, `prs/` and
`appendices/` are immutable provenance (added verbatim, never edited once landed), and a PR body filed
here has its feature-log entry drafted at close-out and appended to the product's public feature log
when the pull request merges: what the change achieved, in no process vocabulary.
